ation","website":"https://www.kimcorealty.com","city":"Jericho","full_time_employees":710,"trailing_pe":29.103447,"forward_pe":29.237875,"price_to_book":1.6436222,"book_value":15.405,"eps_trailing":0.87,"eps_forward":0.866,"dividend_rate":1.04,"dividend_yield":4.11,"payout_ratio":1.1724,"five_yr_avg_div_yield":4.11,"revenue":2161508096.0,"revenue_per_share":3.208,"revenue_growth":0.04,"ebitda":1311730048.0,"ebitda_margins":0.60686,"gross_margins":0.68961,"operating_margins":0.34428,"profit_margins":0.28537,"net_income":583385984.0,"total_cash":168648000.0,"total_cash_per_share":0.25,"total_debt":8308660224.0,"debt_to_equity":78.788,"current_ratio":0.486,"free_cashflow":838712128.0,"return_on_equity":0.058579996,"enterprise_value":25372278784.0,"enterprise_to_ebitda":19.343,"enterprise_to_revenue":11.738,"earnings_growth":0.294,"shares_outstanding":674389792.0,"float_shares":657739108.0,"held_pct_insiders":0.021960001,"held_pct_institutions":1.03194,"beta":0.969,"fifty_two_week_high":26.08,"fifty_two_week_low":19.76,"fifty_day_average":24.2582,"two_hundred_day_avg":22.25565,"target_high_price":29.0,"target_low_price":24.0,"target_mean_price":26.04348,"recommendation":"buy","num_analyst_opinions":23,"all_time_high":53.6,"all_time_low":4.277778,"long_business_summary":"Kimco Realty Corporation is a real estate investment trust (REIT) and leading owner and operator of high-quality, open-air, grocery-anchored shopping centers and mixed-use properties in the United States. The company's portfolio is strategically concentrated in the first-ring suburbs of the top major metropolitan markets, including high-barrier-to-entry coastal markets and Sun Belt cities. Its tenant mix is focused on essential, necessity-based goods and services that drive multiple shopping trips per week. Publicly traded on the NYSE since 1991 and included in the S&P 500 Index, the company has specialized in shopping center ownership, management, acquisitions, and value-enhancing redevelopment activities for more than 65 years. With a proven commitment to corporate responsibility, Kimco Realty is a recognized industry leader in this area. As of March 31, 2026, the company owned interests in 565 U.S. shopping centers and mixed-use assets comprising 100 million square feet of gross leasable space. Kimco Realty Corporation was incorporated in 1958 in Maryland and is based in Jericho, New York."}}